            "description": "**Query params:**\n- `period`: `week` | `month` | `year` | `custom`\n- `start_date` / `end_date`: ISO date strings, only used when `period=custom`\n\n**Response includes:** total_revenue, total_jobs, status_counts breakdown, graph_data time-series points"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"period\": \"week\",\n    \"start_date\": \"2026-07-21\",\n    \"end_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"total_revenue\": 32400.00,\n    \"total_jobs\": 18,\n    \"status_counts\": {\n      \"OPEN\": 2,\n      \"IN_PROGRESS\": 3,\n      \"COMPLETED\": 12,\n      \"CANCELLED\": 1\n    },\n    \"graph_data\": [\n      { \"label\": \"Mon\", \"revenue\": 4200, \"job_count\": 3, \"completed_count\": 2 }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
